ding-6 text-[#aaa49a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"interaction notes list\">\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"hero note\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[#e8e3e9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            Hero:\n                        </span>\n                        52% image band, flat copy plane, one brass action, directions as a quiet text route.\n                    </p>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"families note\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[#e8e3e9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            Families:\n                        </span>\n                        all five canonical showroom names remain visible; rows are 86px minimum with 64px image thumbnails and a 44px+ interaction area.\n                    </p>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"motion note\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[#e8e3e9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            Motion:\n                        </span>\n                        press/focus changes only background, rule, contrast, and arrow position. No scale, autoplay, or perpetual shimmer.\n                    </p>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"taxonomy note\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[#e8e3e9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            Taxonomy:\n                        </span>\n                        every route maps directly to the existing `/collections?category=...` family slugs.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-[#e8e3e9]/10 pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"palette lock section\">\n                    <p class=\"hc-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[#6e6a62]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" 