x;height:16px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"mobile-row w-full border-b border-white/[0.12] pl-3 pr-1 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-left\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen row button\" type=\"button\">\n                                <span class=\"hc-mono w-8 text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#c8a96e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen index\">\n                                    04\n                                </span>\n                                <img alt=\"Kitchen and wardrobes\" class=\"h-[52px] w-[76px] object-cover opacity-[0.82]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/cinema/categories/HC-03-KITCHEN.png\"/>\n                                <span class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen label container\">\n                                    <strong class=\"block hc-serif text-[20px] leading-none font-normal text-[#e8e3e9]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen title\">\n                                        Kitchen & Wardrobes\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <small class=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#6e6a62]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen subtitle\">\n                                        Soft-close · sliding · sinks\n                                    </small>\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-4-4\" data-name=\"mobile kitchen row icon\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1;color:#c8a96e;width:16px;height:16px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"mobile-row w-full pl-3 pr-1 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-left\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"mobile furniture row button\" type=\"button\">\n                                <span class=\"hc-mono w-8 text-[9px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#c8a96e]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"mobile furniture index\">\n                                    05\n                                </span>\n                                <img alt=\"Furniture hardware\" class=\"h-[52px] w-[76px] object-cover opacity-[0.78]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"mobile furniture image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/cinema/categories/HC-03-WARDROBE.png\"/>\n                                <span class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5-3\" data-name=\"mobile furniture label container\">\n                                    <strong class=\"block hc-serif text-[20px] leading-none font-normal text-[#e8e3e9]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile furniture title\">\n                                        Furniture Hardware\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <small class=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#6e6a62]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"mobile furniture subtitle\">\n                                        Hinges · runners · joinery\n                                    </small>\n                                </span>\n                                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-3-2-5-4\" data-name=\"mobile furniture row icon\" style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1;color:#c8a96e;width:16px;height:16px\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-[38px] border-t border-white/[0.12] flex items-center justify-center bg-[#11100f]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"mobile footer bar\">\n                        <span class=\"hc-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#6e6a62]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"mobile footer text\">\n                            Call · WhatsApp · Visit\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</div>\n",
