>\n                            </span>\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right hc-directory-arrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-4-6-4\" data-name=\"arrow-up-right icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hc-mobile-notes\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile notes area\">\n                    <p class=\"hc-section-kicker\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile note kicker\">\n                        Responsive architecture / not a reduced desktop\n                    </p>\n                    <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile note title\">\n                        A vertical facade directory for fast, tactile browsing.\n                    </h3>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"mobile note description\">\n                        The mobile frame keeps the emotional product image separate from the copy plane, then exposes all five canonical showroom families as clear, 56px-plus routes. No horizontal scroller, no inaccurate category labels, and no fixed element competing with the conversion bar.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"hc-note-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"note line\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            01 / HERO\n                        </strong>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"note value\">\n                            4:5 visual bay, independent copy plane, one brass action.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hc-note-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5\" data-name=\"note line\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            02 / INDEX\n                        </strong>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"note value\">\n                            96px image panel, top-aligned family number, direct collection route.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hc-note-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-6\" data-name=\"note line\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            03 / STATE\n                        </strong>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"note value\">\n                            Opacity and rule changes only; no zoom, lift, or perpetual motion.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
